<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</title>
<headline>Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Secretariat weekly estimate, to July 9, of 1996/97 shipments, export commitments and purchases by exporters in indicated crop years</p>
<p> ...........shipments..commits..crop year...exporter purchases</p>
<p>(thousands of tonnes).........................1997/98..1996/97</p>
<p> Bread wheat  8,180.7  9,300.0   Dec-Nov	  121.8  9,424.8</p>
<p> Forrage wheat  188.3    230.0   Dec-Nov	    n/a    188.6</p>
<p> Maize	  7,037.1  7,710.0   Mar-Feb	   11.0  8,008.8</p>
<p> Sorghum	  472.5    500.0   Mar-Feb	    n/a    585.4</p>
<p> Soybeans	 527.5    550.0   Apr-Mar	    4.2  1,284.6</p>
<p> Sunseeds	  22.3     23.0   Jan-Dec	    n/a    171.7</p>
<p>The Secretariat made the following estimates of probable</p>
<p>total 1996/97 exports (thousands of tonnes):</p>
<p> Bread wheat	    10,200.0</p>
<p> Forrage wheat		 n/a</p>
<p> Maize		     9,500.0</p>
<p> Sorghum		     700.0</p>
<p> Soybeans		    600.0</p>
<p> Sunseeds		     50.0</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541-318-0655))</p>
